<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AccuStaff started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AccuStaff started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of AccuStaff Inc and added it to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- AccuStaff gained 8/16 to 28-1/16.</p>
